{"Title":"An Act extending rebates for electric and zero emission vehicles","BillNumber":"H3206","DocketNumber":"HD291","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T13:38:02.583"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AJP1","Name":"Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr.","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AJP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-10T13:38:02.5833333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3206/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Puppolo of Springfield, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3206) of Angelo J. Puppolo, Jr., relative to extending Department Energy Resources' rebates for electric and zero-emission vehicles.  Telecommunications, Utilities and Energy.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 95 of chapter 142 of the acts of 2019 is hereby amended by striking out the figure “$50,000” and inserting in place thereof the following figure:- $100,000.\r\n\tSECTION 2. Said section 95 is hereby further amended by striking out the figure “2021” and inserting in place thereof, each time it occurs, the following figure:- 2024\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J37","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J37"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}